(24, NULL, 3, 'sess_3_20260829', 'assistant', '**Executive Summary: Week-on-Week Sales Performance**\n\n**Direct Answer:** Sales this week declined **93.4%** compared to last week.\n\n---\n\n**Key Figures (All System Branches):**\n\n| Metric | This Week | Last Week | Change |\n|--------|-----------|-----------|--------|\n| **Revenue** | ₦1,523,237.93 | ₦23,245,392 | -₦21,722,154.07 |\n| **Orders** | 25 | 44 | -19 orders |\n| **Profit** | ₦304,899.96 | ₦5,526,607 | -₦5,221,707.04 |\n\n---\n\n**Critical Observations:**\n\n1. **Revenue Collapse:** This week\'s revenue is only ~6.6% of last week\'s total — a dramatic drop.\n2. **Profit Margin:** Profit margin improved slightly (20.0% this week vs. 23.8% last week), but absolute profit fell sharply.\n3. **Today\'s Performance:** Today shows only 3 orders and ₦1,900 revenue with a **negative profit of -₦500** — an urgent concern.\n4. **Yesterday\'s Recovery:** Yesterday was strong (18 orders, ₦1,519,357 revenue), suggesting today\'s slump may be an anomaly or early-day snapshot.\n\n---\n\n**Actionable Insights:**\n\n- **Investigate Today\'s Drop:** With only 3 orders and negative profit today, check for operational issues (staffing, system downtime, stockouts) or if the day is still in progress.\n- **Identify Last Week\'s Spike:** Last week\'s ₦23.2M revenue may have included bulk orders, a promotion, or a major client. Confirm if that was a one-off event.\n- **Monitor Stock Levels:** Given the sharp volume decline, verify inventory is adequate and not causing lost sales.\n\n---\n\n**Recommendation:** Review daily transaction logs for the past 7 days to pinpoint the exact days of decline and correlate with any operational changes or external factors. If today\'s low numbers persist, consider a mid-day operational check.', 'sales_performance', '{\"scope\":\"All System Branches\",\"today\":{\"orders\":3,\"revenue\":1900,\"profit\":-500},\"yesterday\":{\"orders\":18,\"revenue\":1519357.2,\"profit\":304915.21},\"this_week\":{