(26, NULL, 3, 'sess_3_20260829', 'assistant', '**Executive Summary: Inventory Status Report**\n\n**Direct Answer:** Yes, there are **8 inventory items currently out of stock** across all system branches. No items are merely \"low\" — all flagged items are at **zero stock**.\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Out-of-Stock Items (8 Total)\n\n| Item | Category | Stock Level |\n|------|----------|-------------|\n| Coca-Cola 60cl PET | Beverages | 0 |\n| Coca-Cola 35cl Glass Bottle | Beverages | 0 |\n| Coca-Cola 1.5L Family Bottle | Beverages | 0 |\n| Visita Essence B Carrot 200gm | Others | 0 |\n| Checkers Custard Vanilla 2kg | Foods | 0 |\n| Nasco Cornflakes 350g | Foods | 0 |\n| Peak Full Cream Cup 400g | Dairy | 0 |\n| Golden Penny Spread 900g | Baking & Pantry | 0 |\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Key Observations\n\n1. **Beverages are the most affected category** — 3 Coca-Cola SKUs are completely out, which likely impacts high-traffic sales.\n2. **Total stock worth** across all branches is **₦118,978,980.45**, indicating a healthy overall inventory value, but these 8 zero-stock items represent immediate revenue risk.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. **Prioritize restocking Coca-Cola products** — these are fast-moving consumer goods and the most affected category.\n2. **Review reorder points** — all 8 items hit zero simultaneously, suggesting reorder thresholds may be set too low or not actively monitored.\n3. **Check supplier lead times** for the affected items to prevent prolonged stockouts.\n4. **Consider promotional alternatives** for out-of-stock items to retain customer traffic while awaiting replenishment.\n\n---\n\n*Action required: Immediate purchase orders should be raised for all 8 items to prevent further sales loss.*', 'inventory_status', '{\"scope\":\"All System Branches\",\"total_stock_worth\":118978980.45,\"low_stock_count\":8,\"items_at_risk\":[{\"item_name\":\"Coca-Cola 60cl PET\",\"category\":\"Beverages\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Coca-Cola 35cl Glass Bottle\",\"category\":\"Beverages\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Coca-Cola 1.5L Family Bottle\",\"category\":\"Beverages\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Visita Essence B Carrot 200gm\",\"category\":\"Others\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Checkers Custard Vanilla 2kg\",\"category\":\"Foods\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Nasco Cornflakes 350g\",\"category\":\"Foods\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Peak Full Cream Cup 400g\",\"category\":\"Dairy\",\"stock\":0},{\"item_name\":\"Golden Penny Spread 900g\",\"category\":\"Baking & Pantry\",\"stock\":0}]}', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-chat', NULL, 5448, '2026-08-29 02:42:30', '2026-08-29 02:42:30'),
