(28, 2, 6, 'sess_6_20260829', 'assistant', 'Here is your executive summary based on the verified database records for the past 30 days.\n\n---\n\n**Executive Summary: Top 5 Selling Items (Past 30 Days)**\n\n**Scope:** Skynet Digital Hub\n\nBased on units sold, your top 5 items are as follows:\n\n1.  **Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87947cf1228**\n    - **Units Sold:** 24\n    - **Revenue:** ₦6,000\n2.  **Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87948bb801f**\n    - **Units Sold:** 20\n    - **Revenue:** ₦5,000\n3.  **Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87948bb801f (Copy) 1111**\n    - **Units Sold:** 8\n    - **Revenue:** ₦3,500\n4.  **Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87948bb801f (Copy)**\n    - **Units Sold:** 6\n    - **Revenue:** ₦1,500\n5.  **Iphone Xs Max**\n    - **Units Sold:** 3\n    - **Revenue:** ₦1,500,000\n\n---\n\n**Key Insights & Actionable Recommendations:**\n\n- **Revenue vs. Volume Discrepancy:** While \"Product Beta\" variants dominate in volume (58 units total), they generate minimal revenue (₦16,000 combined). In contrast, the **Iphone Xs Max** accounts for nearly 99% of your total revenue (₦1,500,000) with only 3 sales. Your business is heavily reliant on high-ticket items for cash flow.\n- **Data Hygiene Alert:** The top 4 items appear to be duplicate or copy listings of the same \"Product Beta\" product (evidenced by the \"Copy\" suffixes and similar names). This fragments your sales data and makes inventory tracking difficult.\n- **Recommended Next Step:** I strongly suggest merging these duplicate \"Product Beta\" listings into a single SKU in your POS system. This will consolidate your sales metrics, provide accurate stock level reporting, and prevent potential stock conflicts or overselling.', 'top_sellers', '{\"scope\":\"Skynet Digital Hub\",\"period\":\"Past 30 Days\",\"top_items\":[{\"item_name\":\"Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87947cf1228\",\"units_sold\":24,\"revenue\":6000},{\"item_name\":\"Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87948bb801f\",\"units_sold\":20,\"revenue\":5000},{\"item_name\":\"Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87948bb801f (Copy) 1111\",\"units_sold\":8,\"revenue\":3500},{\"item_name\":\"Product Beta (Branch B Only) 6a87948bb801f (Copy)\",\"units_sold\":6,\"revenue\":1500},{\"item_name\":\"Iphone Xs Max\",\"units_sold\":3,\"revenue\":1500000}]}', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-chat', NULL, 5965, '2026-08-29 02:43:09', '2026-08-29 02:43:09'),
