(32, 2, 6, 'sess_6_20260829', 'assistant', '**Executive Summary: Fraud Detection Analysis – Skynet Digital Hub**\n\n**Direct Answer:** Based on the verified database metrics, **no explicit fraudulent transactions are flagged**; however, the data reveals **severe anomalies** that warrant immediate investigation.\n\n---\n\n**Key Figures & Anomalies:**\n\n| Metric | Yesterday | Today | This Week |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Orders** | 15 | 3 | 21 |\n| **Revenue** | ₦1,512,850 | ₦1,900 | ₦1,516,000 |\n| **Profit** | ₦302,850 | **-₦500** | ₦302,600 |\n\n**Critical Observations:**\n\n1.  **Catastrophic Revenue Drop:** Today’s revenue (₦1,900) is **99.87% lower** than yesterday (₦1,512,850). This is not a normal business fluctuation.\n2.  **Negative Profit:** Today’s operations resulted in a **loss of ₦500**, despite generating sales. This implies sales were made at a loss, which is a common indicator of deeply discounted or manipulated transactions.\n3.  **Zero Baseline:** Last week recorded **zero orders and zero revenue**. This creates a highly suspicious \"week-on-week\" growth of 0%, making the sudden spike to ₦1.5M yesterday appear isolated and irregular.\n\n---\n\n**Actionable Insights & Next Steps:**\n\n- **Immediate Audit:** Manually review the **3 orders from today**. Verify the items sold, the prices applied, and the payment method. A loss on every sale is a red flag for employee error, theft, or system manipulation.\n- **Review Yesterday\'s Spike:** Scrutinize the 15 orders from yesterday. Confirm they are legitimate bulk purchases and not a single, high-value transaction split to bypass approval limits.\n- **Check Inventory:** Run a stock variance report. Compare physical stock against system records for the items sold today and yesterday. Discrepancies will confirm if stock was removed without proper sales records.\n- **System Logs:** Check user login times and transaction timestamps for both days to rule out unauthorized access or \"off-hours\" activity.\n\n**Recommendation:** While no fraud is *confirmed*, the data pattern is highly irregular. I strongly advise pausing any further sales until the above audit is completed to prevent potential ongoing losses.', 'sales_performance', '{\"scope\":\"Skynet Digital Hub\",\"today\":{\"orders\":3,\"revenue\":1900,\"profit\":-500},\"yesterday\":{\"orders\":15,\"revenue\":1512850,\"profit\":302850},\"this_week\":{\"orders\":21,\"revenue\":1516000,\"profit\":302600},\"last_week\":{\"orders\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"profit\":0},\"this_month\":{\"orders\":21,\"revenue\":1516000,\"profit\":302600},\"week_on_week_pct\":0}', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-chat', NULL, 7347, '2026-08-29 02:44:56', '2026-08-29 02:44:56'),
