(102, NULL, 3, 'sess_3_20260829', 'assistant', 'Here is your executive-ready performance summary based on the verified cross-branch data for the past 30 days.\n\n---\n\n### 🏆 Staff Performance Leaderboard (Past 30 Days)\n\nBased on the verified database records, **Felix Admin** is the clear top performer across all system branches.\n\n| Rank | Staff Name | Username | Sales Count | Revenue (₦) | Profit Generated (₦) | Avg. Sale Value (₦) | Returns | Refunds (₦) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1** | **Felix Admin** | felix-admin | **81** | **₦24,404,160.54** | **₦5,796,863.64** | ₦301,285.93 | 24 | ₦2,167,704.03 |\n| 2 | sky net | skynet | 23 | ₦1,517,750.00 | ₦302,950.00 | ₦65,989.13 | 0 | ₦0.00 |\n\n### 📊 Key Analytical Insights\n\n- **Dominant Performer:** **Felix Admin** is the undisputed leader, generating **₦24.4M in revenue** and **₦5.8M in profit**. This accounts for **94.1% of total revenue** and **95.0% of total profit** across the entire system.\n- **Volume & Efficiency:** Felix processed **3.5x more transactions** (81 vs. 23) and achieved a significantly higher average sale value (**₦301,285.93** vs. **₦65,989.13**), indicating superior upselling or handling of higher-value orders.\n- **Risk Flag (Felix Admin):** While performance is stellar, Felix processed **24 returns** and **₦2.17M in refunds**. This represents **8.9% of his total revenue** and is a metric that warrants monitoring to ensure it reflects legitimate customer service activity rather than operational inefficiency.\n- **Secondary Performer:** \"sky net\" shows solid, clean performance with **zero returns or refunds**, but operates at a much smaller scale (₦1.5M revenue), suggesting a support or junior role.\n\n### 🎯 Key Takeaways\n\n- **Recognition:** Felix Admin should be formally recognized for exceptional sales volume and profit contribution this month.\n- **Investigation:** A closer look into Felix\'s 24 returns is recommended to rule out any procedural issues, though the high net profit suggests strong overall performance.\n- **Development:** \"sky net\" demonstrates clean execution but low volume; consider cross-training or upskilling to increase their transaction count and average basket size.', 'staff_performance_ranking', '{\"scope\":\"All System Branches (Cross-Branch)\",\"period\":\"Past 30 Days\",\"total_staff\":2,\"top_performer\":\"Felix Admin\",\"leaderboard\":[{\"rank\":1,\"name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"username\":\"felix-admin\",\"sales_count\":81,\"revenue\":24404160.54,\"profit_generated\":5796863.64,\"average_sale\":301285.932593,\"discounts_given\":0,\"returns_count\":24,\"refunds_processed\":2167704.03},{\"rank\":2,\"name\":\"sky net\",\"username\":\"skynet\",\"sales_count\":23,\"revenue\":1517750,\"profit_generated\":302950,\"average_sale\":65989.130435,\"discounts_given\":0,\"returns_count\":0,\"refunds_processed\":0}]}', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-chat', NULL, 6992, '2026-08-29 12:55:54', '2026-08-29 12:55:54'),
