(123, NULL, 3, 'sess_3_20260829', 'assistant', 'Good day. Here is your executive briefing for **All System Branches (Cross-Branch)** based on the latest verified data.\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Performance Snapshot (Cross-Branch)\n\n| Metric | Today | This Week | Last Week | This Month |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Orders** | 5 | 27 | 44 | 104 |\n| **Revenue** | ₦3,650.00 | ₦1,524,987.93 | ₦23,245,392.00 | ₦25,921,910.54 |\n| **Profit** | -₦150.00 | ₦305,249.96 | ₦5,526,607.00 | ₦6,099,813.64 |\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Key Insights & Risk Flags\n\n1.  **Critical Week-on-Week Contraction:** The system is experiencing a **severe -93.4% decline** in week-on-week performance. Revenue has dropped from **₦23.2M** last week to **₦1.5M** this week, with profit contracting by **94.5%** (from ₦5.5M to ₦305K). This is a **Critical Risk Flag** indicating a major operational halt or data reporting issue.\n2.  **Today\'s Negative Margin:** Today\'s trading shows a **loss of -₦150.00** on revenue of just ₦3,650.00. While the absolute loss is small, the negative margin indicates that operational costs or discounts are exceeding sales for the day.\n3.  **Inventory Pressure:** With **201 low-stock items** out of **1,411 total products** (14.2%), there is a significant risk of stockouts that could further suppress sales if the current downward trend continues.\n\n---\n\n#### Strategic Recommendations\n\n- **Immediate Investigation:** Prioritize an urgent audit of the last 48 hours. The drastic drop from ₦23M to ₦1.5M in weekly revenue suggests a potential system integration failure, a major branch closure, or a data synchronization error rather than a natural market shift.\n- **Review Today\'s Loss:** Analyze today\'s 5 orders to identify if excessive discounts or refunds were applied, as this is driving the negative profit margin.\n- **Inventory Replenishment:** Given the high low-stock count, initiate immediate purchase orders for fast-moving items to prepare for a potential sales recovery and avoid lost revenue.\n\n**Momentum Indicator:** **Contracting** (Critical). All metrics are trending sharply downward.', 'sales_performance', '{\"scope\":\"All System Branches (Cross-Branch)\",\"today\":{\"orders\":5,\"revenue\":3650,\"profit\":-150},\"this_week\":{\"orders\":27,\"revenue\":1524987.93,\"profit\":305249.96},\"last_week\":{\"orders\":44,\"revenue\":23245392,\"profit\":5526607},\"this_month\":{\"orders\":104,\"revenue\":25921910.54,\"profit\":6099813.64},\"week_on_week_pct\":-93.4,\"total_products\":1411,\"low_stock_count\":201}', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-chat', NULL, 6315, '2026-08-29 13:24:21', '2026-08-29 13:24:21'),
