(151, 2, 6, 'sess_6_20260829', 'assistant', 'Based on the verified database records for **Skynet Digital Hub**, the risk assessment is as follows:\n\n### Executive Risk Summary\n\n**Overall Verdict: CLEAN — No Suspicious Activity Detected**\n\nThe branch shows a **Low / Clean** risk profile with zero indicators of fraud, excessive discounting, or financial leakage.\n\n---\n\n### Key Risk Indicators (Verified Metrics)\n\n| Risk Metric | Status / Value | Interpretation |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Overall Risk Level** | **Low / Clean** | No systemic or transactional threats identified. |\n| **Active Conflicts** | **0** | No staff or system conflicts logged. |\n| **Total Discounts (30d)** | **₦0.00** | No discount abuse or margin erosion. |\n| **Total Refunds (30d)** | **₦0.00** | No suspicious return cycles or cash-out schemes. |\n| **Outstanding Debt** | **₦0.00** | No uncollected liabilities or bad debt exposure. |\n| **Risk Flags** | **None** | No automated alerts triggered. |\n| **Discount by Cashier** | **Empty** | No staff member is issuing abnormal discounts. |\n| **Returns by Cashier** | **Empty** | No staff member is processing unusual refunds. |\n| **Recent Write-Offs** | **None** | No inventory shrinkage or unexplained stock losses. |\n\n---\n\n### Analytical Commentary\n\n- **Zero Discount Volume:** The complete absence of discounts over the last 30 days eliminates the primary vector for revenue leakage through price manipulation.\n- **Zero Refund Activity:** With no refunds processed, there is no risk of \"refund fraud\" where cash is siphoned via fake returns.\n- **No Write-Offs:** The lack of stock write-offs confirms inventory integrity, ruling out theft or misreporting.\n\n---\n\n#### Key Takeaways\n\n- **Operational Integrity:** The branch is operating with **perfect transactional hygiene**.\n- **No Action Required:** There are no anomalies to investigate, no cashier to audit, and no policy breaches to correct.\n- **Maintain Current Controls:** The