INSERT INTO `ai_conversation_logs` (`id`, `branch_id`, `user_id`, `session_id`, `role`, `message`, `detected_intent`, `structured_payload`, `provider_used`, `model_used`, `tokens_used`, `execution_time_ms`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(159, 1, 1, 'sess_1_20260902', 'assistant', 'Based on the verified 7-day audit trail for **Felix Enterprise**, I have identified **several high-risk anomalies** that warrant immediate attention, including a **negative-value sale**, **suspiciously high discount rates**, and **concerning return patterns**.\n\nHere is the full executive breakdown:\n\n---\n\n### 🚨 CRITICAL ALERT: Negative Sale Transaction (Potential Fraud / System Abuse)\nThe most severe red flag is a sale processed with a **negative total**, which should never occur in a standard transaction.\n\n| Receipt ID | Staff | Date/Time | Grand Total | Item Count | Risk |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **RC202608310152** | Felix Admin | Aug 31, 12:58 PM | **-₦120.25** | 1 | **CRITICAL** |\n\n- **Analysis:** This transaction effectively **added money to the cash drawer** or was used to offset another transaction. This is a classic sign of a **voided sale being misrecorded**, a **price override error**, or an attempt to **manipulate cash balances**. It requires immediate reconciliation against the physical cash count for that shift.\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ HIGH RISK: Excessive Discount Rates\nThe discount-to-revenue ratio is abnormally high, indicating potential **unauthorized price overrides** or **\"sweetheart deals\"** (giving friends/family discounts at the company\'s expense).\n\n| Staff Member | Orders | Revenue (₦) | Discounts Given (₦) | Discount Rate | Profit (₦) | Risk Level |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Jane Cashier** | 4 | 2,505.00 | 2,330.24 | **93.0%** | **-769.77** | **CRITICAL** |\n| **Felix Admin** | 14 | 93,225.11 | 78,970.92 | **84.7%** | 76,290.84 | **HIGH** |\n| Super Admin | 1 | 730.73 | 0.00 | 0.0% | 234.75 | Normal |\n\n- **Analysis:** **Jane Cashier** is selling items at a **93% discount**, resulting in a **net loss** on every sale. **Felix Admin** is also discounting at ~85%. While the \"profit\" figure for Felix Admin is high, this is likely a data artifact; the sheer volume of discounts suggests **systemic pricing abuse** or a **misconfiguration in the discount engine**. These rates are not sustainable for a business.\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ HIGH RISK: Suspicious Return Patterns\nMultiple returns were processed in a very short window, including one with **no reason provided** and another for an **\"expired\"** product that was likely sold recently.\n\n| Staff | Date/Time | Item | Reason | Qty Returned | Risk |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Felix Admin | Sep 2, 05:45 PM | Schweppes Bitter Lemon 35cl | Expired | 1 | Medium |\n| Felix Admin | Sep 2, 05:45 PM | Chivita 100% 200ml | Wrong product | 1 | Medium |\n| Felix Admin | Sep 2, 05:43 PM | Schweppes Bitter Lemon 50cl | **No reason provided** | 1 | **High** |\n\n- **Analysis:** The return of a **Schweppes Bitter Lemon 50cl** with **no reason** is a red flag. This could be a **post-sale price adjustment** disguised as a return to avoid proper discount authorization. The other returns (expired/wrong product) are plausible but should be verified against the original sale receipts.\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 MEDIUM RISK: Inventory Adjustment Anomaly\nA massive stock adjustment was logged that is inconsistent with normal operations.\n\n| Staff | Date/Time | Item | Qty Change | Previous Qty | New Qty | Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Felix Admin | Sep 1, 11:53 PM | KissKids Baby Diapers Size 2 | **+400** | 1 | 401 | \"new stocks\" |\n\n- **Analysis:** While adding new stock is normal, a **+400 unit increase** logged as an \"adjustment\" rather than a formal \"purchase\" or \"stock-in\" is unusual. This bypasses standard procurement tracking and could hide **unrecorded purchases** or **theft** if the physical stock doesn\'t match.\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Staff Activity Summary (Past 7 Days)\n- **Total Activity Events:** 35\n- **Active Staff:** Felix Admin, Jane Cashier, Super Admin\n- **Sales Volume:** Felix Admin (14 orders), Jane Cashier (4 orders), Super Admin (1 order)\n- **Notable:** Felix Admin logged in **10 times** over the period, including a late-night login on **Sep 1 at 11:40 PM** followed by the large inventory adjustment at **11:53 PM**.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Executive Recommendations\n1.  **Immediate Cash Reconciliation:** Conduct an **urgent physical cash count** for the shift on **Aug 31** to reconcile the **-₦120.25** sale.\n2.  **Audit Discount Policies:** Review the discount permissions for **Jane Cashier** and **Felix Admin**. A 93% discount rate is a business-killer. Consider implementing a **hard cap** on discount percentages for cashiers.\n3.  **Investigate Returns:** Pull the original receipts for the returns on **Sep 2** to ensure the items were actually sold and the refunds were legitimate.\n4.  **Verify Stock Adjustment:** Physically count the **KissKids Diapers** to confirm the 401 units are actually in the warehouse.\n5.  **Review Late-Night Activity:** Scrutinize all actions taken by Felix Admin after **11:00 PM** on Sep 1, as this is a high-risk time for fraudulent activity.', 'staff_activity_audit', '{\"scope\":\"Felix Enterprise\",\"target_staff\":\"All Staff Members\",\"period\":\"Past 7 Days (Weekly Audit Trail)\",\"total_activity_events\":35,\"activity_logs\":[{\"id\":516,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"sale\",\"log_summary\":\"Completed sale #RC202609020162 totaling \\u20a680,625.00 via Cash\",\"details\":{\"receipt_id\":\"RC202609020162\",\"grand_total\":80625,\"payment_method\":\"Cash\",\"item_count\":1,\"customer_id\":null},\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-02 18:02:54\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 2, 06:02 PM (7 minutes ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":515,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"return\",\"log_summary\":\"Processed sale return for 2 item(s)\",\"details\":{\"sale_id\":161,\"item_count\":2},\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-02 17:45:38\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 2, 05:45 PM (24 minutes ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":514,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"return\",\"log_summary\":\"Processed sale return for 1 item(s)\",\"details\":{\"sale_id\":161,\"item_count\":1},\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-02 17:43:06\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 2, 05:43 PM (27 minutes ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":513,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"sale\",\"log_summary\":\"Completed sale #RC202609020161 totaling \\u20a6628.67 via Cash\",\"details\":{\"receipt_id\":\"RC202609020161\",\"grand_total\":628.67,\"payment_method\":\"Cash\",\"item_count\":3,\"customer_id\":null},\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-02 17:42:13\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 2, 05:42 PM (28 minutes ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":512,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"auth\",\"log_summary\":\"User Felix Admin logged into branch \'Felix Enterprise\'\",\"details\":null,\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-02 16:15:24\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 2, 04:15 PM (1 hour ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":511,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"auth\",\"log_summary\":\"User Felix Admin logged into branch \'Felix Enterprise\'\",\"details\":null,\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-02 12:44:13\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 2, 12:44 PM (5 hours ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":510,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"auth\",\"log_summary\":\"User Felix Admin logged into branch \'Felix Enterprise\'\",\"details\":null,\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-01 23:40:51\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 1, 11:40 PM (18 hours ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":509,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"auth\",\"log_summary\":\"User Felix Admin logged into branch \'Felix Enterprise\'\",\"details\":null,\"exact_time\":\"2026-09-01 17:17:50\",\"time_human\":\"Sep 1, 05:17 PM (1 day ago)\",\"branch\":\"Felix Enterprise\"},{\"id\":508,\"staff_name\":\"Felix Admin\",\"action_type\":\"auth\",\"log_summary\":\"User Felix Admin logged into branch \'Felix Enterprise\'\",\"details\":null,\"exact_time\":