(180, 1, 3, 'session_6ab7b0fe79eb4', 'assistant', '**No customers are overdue by more than 30 days at Felix Enterprise.** There are **0 overdue debtors** and **₦0.00** in aged debt beyond the 30-day threshold.\n\n### Overdue Debt Summary (>30 Days)\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Branch Scope | Felix Enterprise |\n| Overdue Debtors (>30 days) | **0** |\n| Total Overdue Amount | **₦0.00** |\n| Total Debtors on Record | 1 |\n\n### Key Takeaways\n- **No aged debt risk detected** — no customer has gone more than 30 days without payment.\n- There is **1 active debtor** on record, but their balance is **not yet past the 30-day overdue threshold**.\n- No overdue debtor list is available to display because the verified records returned an empty `overdue_debtors` array.\n\nIf you\'d like, I can pull the current balance and recent payment history for the single active debtor to confirm how close they are to the 30-day mark.', 'customer_debt_analysis', '{\"scope\":\"Felix Enterprise\",\"type\":\"overdue_30_days\",\"total_overdue_amount\":0,\"overdue_debtors_count\":0,\"total_debtors\":1,\"overdue_debtors\":[]}', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-chat', NULL, 2026, '2026-09-26 11:48:16', '2026-09-26 11:48:16'),
